  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji 5-year Carbon Budget</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Fiji&apos;s Ministry of Economy to develop the country&apos;s first 5-year carbon budget as required under Fiji&apos;s Climate Change Act adopted in 2021. The project will identify the appropriate approach and methodology to prepare carbon budget and develop the carbon budget for government consideration and approval.Outputs:- A recommended methodological approach to determine indicative carbon budget- Identify and collect all data requirements to develop the carbon budget and compile the GHG data- Fiji&amp;rsquo;s indicative carbon budget (2026-2030)- Refined Carbon Budget Methodology for current and future carbon budgets- Fiji&amp;rsquo;s Updated Carbon Budget (2026-2030)</narrative>
  </description>
